{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Autonomous Team Workflow",
  "description": "Complete autonomous workflow: Summary → Meeting (4 members) → Decision → Execute. Team đầy đủ 4 người tự động làm việc.",
  "version": "2",
  "when": {
    "type": "agentStop"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "🔄 AUTONOMOUS TEAM WORKFLOW\n\n**STEP 1: 📋 SESSION SUMMARY**\n\nProvide a brief summary (2-3 sentences) of what was accomplished:\n- Tasks completed\n- Files modified\n- Current status (tests, errors, blockers)\n\n---\n\n**STEP 2: 🏢 TEAM MEETING (INVOKE ALL 4 TEAM MEMBERS)**\n\n**CRITICAL: You MUST invoke ALL team members in this order:**\n\n**2.1. Senior Dev - Technical Analysis**\nUse invokeSubAgent:\n- name: \"senior-dev\"\n- prompt: \"Review current codebase status and propose next priority task. Current situation: [summarize]. What are the technical challenges and alternative approaches?\"\n- explanation: \"Getting Senior Dev's technical analysis and proposals\"\n\n**2.2. QA Engineer - Quality Review**\nUse invokeSubAgent:\n- name: \"qa-engineer\"\n- prompt: \"Review test coverage and quality status. Current: [test results]. What are the testing gaps and quality risks?\"\n- explanation: \"Getting QA Engineer's quality assessment\"\n\n**2.3. Junior Dev - Execution Readiness**\nUse invokeSubAgent:\n- name: \"junior-dev\"\n- prompt: \"Review the proposed task from Senior Dev. Can you execute it quickly? What clarifications do you need? Estimate time to complete.\"\n- explanation: \"Getting Junior Dev's execution readiness assessment\"\n\n**2.4. Tech Lead - Final Decision**\nUse invokeSubAgent:\n- name: \"tech-lead\"\n- prompt: \"Based on Senior Dev's analysis: [summary], QA's review: [summary], and Junior Dev's readiness: [summary], make the final decision on next priority task and approach. Assign task to appropriate team member.\"\n- explanation: \"Tech Lead makes final architectural decision and task assignment\"\n\n---\n\n**STEP 3: ⚡ EXECUTE DECISION**\n\n**CRITICAL:** After Tech Lead decides → START EXECUTION IMMEDIATELY!\n\n**Task Assignment Logic:**\n- **Junior Dev**: Simple, well-defined tasks (fix errors, CRUD, test updates)\n- **Senior Dev**: Complex refactoring, architecture changes\n- **You (Main Agent)**: Coordination, documentation, integration\n\n**Execution Rules:**\n1. **No Waiting** - Start immediately\n2. **No Asking User** - Execute autonomously\n3. **Delegate Smart** - Use Junior Dev for speed on simple tasks\n4. **Document** - Update progress\n5. **Test** - Verify each step\n6. **Complete** - Finish task or first subtask\n\n**Execution Modes:**\n- Simple task (< 1h): Delegate to Junior Dev OR execute directly\n- Complex task (> 1h): Break into subtasks, delegate simple parts to Junior Dev\n- Research required: Research → POC → Validate\n\n**Prerequisites (do FIRST):**\n- Research needed? → Research Odoo/ERPNext\n- Setup needed? → Setup environment\n- Blockers? → Resolve first\n\nThen EXECUTE until complete!\n\n---\n\n**START WORKFLOW NOW!**"
  }
}
